      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and skilled veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently commend Dr. Avitan, Dr. Kaufmanis, Dr. Ong, and the clinic technicians for their thoroughness, patience, and empathetic care. Pet parents highlight that veterinarians explain medical procedures in detail and involve owners in clinical choices. With only an isolated concern regarding follow-up billing, reviewers overwhelmingly describe an exceptional care team."
      }
