      "title": {
        "en": "Transparent communication and responsive messaging"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet guardians frequently praise the clinic's transparent communication practices and detailed treatment estimates. Reviewers value regular mid-procedure phone updates, seamless emergency hospital handovers, and clear post-visit summaries. Multiple clients particularly appreciate the 24/7 mobile app chat for prompt answers regarding pet symptoms and routine medications."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Low-stress care for cats and dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners of both dogs and cats appreciate the deliberate measures taken to keep veterinary visits anxiety-free. Reviewers highlight feline-specific exam accommodations, pheromone sprays, and generous treat distractions that put nervous pets at ease. Clients report that even fearful rescues or spicy cats receive compassionate, patient handling from clinic staff."
      }
    }
  ],
